      "title": "Meridian Grid climate pledge",
      "kind": "climate",
      "summary": "A regional utility pledges an absolute emissions cut. Five reports show a faithful restatement, a silent redefinition, a disclosed revision, an incomplete report and a withheld one that cannot be read.",
